<tr><td><strong>Malla</strong></td><td>Kushinara, Pava</td><td>Eastern U.P. (Gorakhpur)</td><td>Gana-sangha</td><td>Two branches; Buddha died at Kushinara (Mahaparinirvana); Mahavira died at Pava</td></tr>
